    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41561" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-φροσύνη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thoughtfulness, wisdom,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ μὴ ἐπιφροσύνην δῶκε..Ἀθήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.437
				</span></i>
			 : in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφροσύνας ἀνελέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				658
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1115
			</span></i> ; <i>observation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				762
			</span></i> ; <i>prudent reserve,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.659
			</span></i> : also in late Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεία ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.203
				</span></i>
			, al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐπιφροσύνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					15.11.3
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν Σεβαστοῦ Καίσαρος ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					<u>Praef.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
